<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 414)</h2>
<p><b>Camera gates by their real names.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>The gate catalog now carries ARRI's actual sensor formats — LF Open Gate (4448×3096), ALEXA 35 Open Gate (4608×3164), 3.4K Open Gate, 65 Open Gate, 2:1 and friends — in the Measure From menu, on the gate outline label, and in Auto-Detect, which snaps to the nearest real format within 1%.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
